ion":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","color":"447744","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-23T17:11:01Z","updated_at":"2026-03-23T19:45:49Z","closed_at":"2026-03-23T19:45:43Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nv4.6.1.stable.official [14d19694e]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.6.1.stable - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility)\n\n### Issue description\n\nPressing the buttons on top of floating embedded game let's you type in the script editor which usually results in typing inputs into the script and messing it up and having to undo it.\nDemonstration:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6c228fa4-f22b-49a9-882f-a22c5b3989e6\n\nThis happens because pressing the top buttons defocuses the game window (likely because the embedded window and the top buttons are from two separate windows), but I don't think it letting you interact with the current main screen (workspaces, script editor) is expected. Still I think it would be the most convenient if pressing any of the buttons simply immediatly refocused the window, or at least a warning was added when the game window is not in focus.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Run project while the script editor is open.\n- Suspend and unsuspend running project in the floating embedded game editor, don't manually refocus the game window.\n- Start pressing any keys, it should start typing in the script editor.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117756/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117756/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"duplicate","pinned_comment":null}